            "description": "Low cost, low power PCIe* and OCP adapters. Supports 10/5/2.5/1GbE and 100Mb. Backward compatible with existing 1000BASE-T networks, simplifying the transition to 10Gb Ethernet. Optimized for network virtualization overlays.",
