            "localizedName": "Intel® Stratix® 10 FPGAs and SoC FPGAs",
            "description": "The Intel® Stratix® FPGAs and SoC series combine high density and high performance with a rich feature to enable more functions and maximize system bandwidth, allowing customers to bring high-performance, state-of-the-art products to market faster with lower risk.",
