            "localizedName": "Intel® Arria® 10 FPGAs and SoC FPGAs",
            "description": "The Intel® Arria® device family has a rich feature set of memory, logic, and digital signal processing (DSP) blocks combined with the superior signal integrity of up to 25.78 Gbps transceivers that allow you to integrate more functions and maximize system bandwidth.",
